          <a class="row-card__heading glue-link" href=https://research.google/pubs/cold-start-latency-of-quantized-small-language-models-on-serverless-cpu-infrastructure/ >
            
              Cold Start Latency of Quantized Small Language Models on Serverless CPU Infrastructure
            
          </a>
        
        <div class="row-card__subheading">
          
            
              
                
                  
                    <div class="row-card__subheading__item small-text">
                      
